  "2026-07-27T14:07:53.993Z","harness:codex","Delivery PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/774 at implementation head 8173f7f73. Exact-head hosted checks and bot review will follow after this PM evidence is committed."
  "2026-07-27T14:18:29.732Z","harness:codex","Hosted feedback correction for PR #774: the first smoke run proved the new ratchet incorrectly depended on a globally installed pm executable. The script now defaults to this checkout's built dist/cli.js through process.execPath while preserving explicit PM_BIN overrides. The exact context entitlement gate and focused tests pass locally."
  "2026-07-27T14:35:28.208Z","harness:codex","Final gate correction: pruning the obsolete DeepScan-identified suppression reduced the real checked-in ESLint suppression baseline from 133 to 132. Tightened the static-quality default, package gate, and both release contract mirrors to 132 so the removed suppression cannot silently return. Focused release contracts passed 51/51; ESLint, static quality, package boundary, 17-surface token gate, SDK snapshot, SDK entrypoint costs, and CLI transport floor all pass."
  "2026-07-27T14:59:24.681Z","harness:codex","Greptile review correction: aligned measurement tokens with the published ceil(bytes/4) SDK formula and made baseline comparison bidirectional, so removed/renamed/omitted command and contracts surfaces now fail as stale instead of shrinking aggregates unnoticed. Focused review regression tests and the real 95-surface ratchet pass."
  "2026-07-27T15:08:18.190Z","harness:codex","Coverage gate correction: added an incomplete-baseline case that exercises missing contracts and command maps through the real comparison primitive, proving fail-closed missing-surface diagnostics without ignore pragmas. Focused ratchet tests pass 12/12 and ESLint passes."
